WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Add a recording

00:04.000 --> 00:08.780
Split it into steps where the explanation changes

00:08.780 --> 00:18.840
Type captions right on the preview

00:18.840 --> 00:24.290
For a zoom, draw a box around the area to show

00:24.290 --> 00:29.880
Play it back to check on the spot

00:29.880 --> 00:34.630
Boxes and arrows go on the preview too

00:34.630 --> 00:38.355
Click Export

00:38.355 --> 00:42.405
Wait for the export to finish (sped up)

00:42.405 --> 00:45.668
The mp4 is ready

00:45.668 --> 01:03.628
The finished video
